# --- REMOVED 2026-08-06: catch-all splat rules caused a redirect loop -------
# The rules /research/players/* -> /research/players/ (and the entities and
# /e/ equivalents) were added in July 2026 to soften post-rebake 404s. They
# were wrong on two counts:
#   1. In Cloudflare _redirects a splat matches ZERO or more characters, so
#      /research/players/ matched its own rule and 301'd to itself — an
#      infinite loop that took the whole directory offline.
#   2. _redirects are evaluated BEFORE static assets on Pages, so live detail
#      pages were caught too, not just missing ones.
# Missing entity pages should simply 404; that is honest and Google de-indexes
# them cleanly. The specific one-to-one redirects above are unaffected.
